  m_isOn: 0
  m_screenText: {fileID: 4015054726430616791}
  m_message: She waits where the shadows stretch long, her hollow eyes watching,
    her tiny hands reaching. Forgotten but never alone, she longs for home. Follow
    the echoes of laughter long lost, where dust dances and silence hums. Return
    her, before she weeps... before she wakes.
